act, location, crowd, atmosphere/VFX, guide-frame, and graphic image assets: follow the row prompt exactly and use this style lock only as art direction.\nFor voice, sound design, and music rows: do not generate an image here; use the included AUDIO_PROMPT_STYLE_BRIDGE.md to translate this visual style into audio language.\n\nOUTPUT RULES\nNo captions, no watermarks, no logos, no UI, no accidental letters, no border frames, no extra graphic elements unless the row prompt explicitly requires a graphic deliverable. Keep the asset clean enough to use as a production reference or guide frame.",
